---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="这里暂时没有你要找的页面。">
  <section class="not-found shell">
    <p class="not-found__code">404</p>
    <p class="eyebrow">Lost page</p>
    <h1>这里暂时没有你要找的页面。</h1>
    <p>链接可能已经变化，也可能只是一次走错方向。你可以回到首页，或继续看看最近的文章。</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a class="button" href="/blog/">进入博客</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    min-height: 68vh;
    padding-block: 110px;
  }

  .not-found__code {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(135, 152, 255, 0.13);
    font-size: clamp(7rem, 28vw, 18rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.1em;
    line-height: 0.72;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 14px 0;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.7rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .not-found > p:not(.not-found__code, .eyebrow) {
    max-width: 590px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
